`Encoded PowerShell: Sysmon process creation with -EncodedCommand/-enc on the command line. Decode the payload to confirm.`
index=sysmon sourcetype="*WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| search CommandLine="*EncodedCommand*" OR CommandLine="*-enc*" OR CommandLine="*-e *"
| table _time, host, Image, ParentImage, CommandLine
